*.pyc
node_modules/
.DS_Store
chess-frontend/dist/

# The host virtualenv - Linux-specific and rebuilt from requirements.txt.
venv/
.venv/

# Backups taken during editing sessions (this tree has no history of its own,
# so files get copied aside before risky edits).
*.bak
*.bak2

# graphify knowledge graph output (generated, never commit)
graphify-out/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent workspace - kept on disk, out of the public repository.
#
# Two AI agents work in this tree and both read CLAUDE.md, which is the
# working source of truth for how to run, test and not regress the app. It is
# a control file for the people and agents building the product, not part of
# the product, so it is not published with it; it is still here locally, and
# backed up outside the repository. Anything a reader needs in order to run
# or understand Zugzwang belongs in README.md or docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.codex/

# One-off patch scripts from early development, superseded by the git history.
archive/

# Internal planning specs and plans.
docs/superpowers/

# Recorded demo material (tools/record-demo.mjs). Videos are megabytes and
# are regenerated by running the script; the repository is not where they
# belong.
artifacts/
